<item>
            <title>[JGVT-2631] Balance Interface: Auto-trigger reason for change when overriding Actual Amt</title>
                <link>https://jira.jnj.com/browse/JGVT-2631</link>
                <project id="46901" key="JGVT">TDS - Revvity Signals ELN</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;As a user&lt;/b&gt; I want to log a &quot;Reason for Change&quot; when modifying Actual Amt (weight) measured data to comply with the regulatory requirements.&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;Development Notes&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Mockup in ppt: &lt;a href=&quot;https://jnj.sharepoint.com/:p:/r/teams/NextGenELNforTDS/Shared%20Documents/General/1.%20Revvity/07.%20User%20Workshops/GxP%20Release%203.0.0/GxP%20Template/Reason%20for%20Change/RfC_Balance%20Interface-Measurement_Mock%20Up.pptx?d=wa01082297a944c46a5e123f839b5a2fd&amp;amp;csf=1&amp;amp;web=1&amp;amp;e=CvUWPA&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;RfC_Balance Interface-Measurement_Mock Up.pptx&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Re-measure logic should be applied to all weigh methods.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Direct: Actual Amt (as described in the story above)&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Residual Difference: &quot;Pan + Sample&quot;&#160; and&#160; &#160;&quot;Pan + Residual&quot; =&amp;gt; re-measure when Actual Amt is populated&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Difference: &quot;Tare (Pan)&quot;&#160; and&#160; &quot;Total Amt (Pan + Sample)&quot; =&amp;gt; re-measure when Actual Amt is populated&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;Testing Notes&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;To be tested for all weigh methods - see development notes&lt;/p&gt;</description>
