                            <comment id="19555201" author="JIRAUSER182813" created="Thu, 7 May 2026 01:46:43 +0200"  >&lt;p&gt;Measure button doesn&apos;t appear after providing &amp;lt;Reason For Change&amp;gt; for Residual Difference or Difference weigh methods. Please check.&lt;/p&gt;

